@host = http://localhost:5050
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### ── Health Check ──
GET {{host}}/health

### ── Test: Public Endpoint ──
GET {{host}}/api/test/public

### ══════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### Login (token almak için — önce bunu çalıştırın)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Şifre Değiştir
POST {{host}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "Admin123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPass123!"
}

### ══════════════════════════════════════
### USERS
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### Tüm Kullanıcıları Listele
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kullanıcı Detayı (id değiştirin)
GET {{host}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Yeni Kullanıcı Oluştur
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "username": "kasiyer1",
  "password": "Kasiyer123!",
  "fullName": "Test Kasiyer",
  "role": "Cashier"
}

### ══════════════════════════════════════
### CATEGORIES
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### Tüm Kategorileri Listele
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Yeni Kategori Oluştur
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "İçecekler",
  "description": "Soğuk ve sıcak içecekler"
}

### Kategori Güncelle (id değiştirin)
PUT {{host}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "İçecekler (Güncel)",
  "description": "Tüm içecek çeşitleri"
}

### Kategori Sil
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ══════════════════════════════════════
### PRODUCTS
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### Tüm Ürünleri Listele
GET {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Barkod ile Ürün Ara
GET {{host}}/api/products/barcode/8690000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Yeni Ürün Oluştur
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "barcode": "8690000000001",
  "name": "Test Ürün",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "purchasePrice": 10.00,
  "salePrice": 15.00,
  "stockQuantity": 100
}

### ══════════════════════════════════════
### CUSTOMERS
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### Tüm Müşterileri Listele
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Yeni Müşteri Oluştur
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Ali Yılmaz",
  "phone": "05551234567",
  "email": "ali@example.com"
}

### ══════════════════════════════════════
### SALES
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### Tüm Satışları Listele
GET {{host}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Yeni Satış Oluştur
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "customerId": null,
  "paymentType": "Cash",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### ══════════════════════════════════════
### STOCK MOVEMENTS
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### Stok Hareketlerini Listele
GET {{host}}/api/stockmovements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stok Girişi Yap
POST {{host}}/api/stockmovements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 50,
  "movementType": "In",
  "description": "Tedarikçiden alım"
}

### ══════════════════════════════════════
### REPORTS & DASHBOARD
### ══════════════════════════════════════

### Dashboard Verileri
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Satış Raporu
GET {{host}}/api/reports/sales?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excel Export
GET {{host}}/api/reports/sales/export?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
